### Health check
GET http://localhost:4000/api/health

### List with pagination
GET http://localhost:4000/api/internships?page=1&limit=3

### Search and filter
GET http://localhost:4000/api/internships?search=Python&mode=hybrid

### Get one (replace ID with an actual ID from the list response)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/internships/REPLACE_WITH_ID

### Create
POST http://localhost:4000/api/internships
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "React Developer Intern",
  "company": "Example Tech",
  "domain": "Frontend Development",
  "mode": "remote",
  "location": "India",
  "description": "Build and test reusable React components for a web application.",
  "skills": ["React", "JavaScript", "CSS"],
  "openings": 2,
  "applyUrl": "https://example.com/apply"
}

### Update (replace ID)
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/internships/REPLACE_WITH_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "openings": 4
}

### Delete (replace ID)
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/internships/REPLACE_WITH_ID
